  "description": "THE PURE POWER TEST (Dean, 2026-08-09). tier-flat and no-printed-vp combined: every Tier 2 and Tier 3 card costs 1 suit card, and no card in the game prints any VP in its corner. A card can now only be built because a player wants what its TEXT does. Abilities, thresholds and Endgame gameEnd scoring are untouched. This is the fourth cell of a 2x2 (price on/off by VP on/off) and it is the one that answers the question the other three cannot: is the ability worth an action?",
